{"translation":{"id":"aii_abt","name":"ܕܝܬܩܐ ܚܕܬܐ ܕܡܪܢ ܝܫܘܥ ܡܫܝܚܐ ܘܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ ܒܠܫܢܐ ܐܬܘܪܝܐ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"ABT","englishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic NT+Psalms","language":"aii","textDirection":"rtl","sha256":"1859152dbbffe55d2b7ac6d4c09fbad5a6416ca25359e69220bb358dac602444","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/books.json","numberOfBooks":28,"totalNumberOfChapters":410,"totalNumberOfVerses":10420,"languageName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic","languageEnglishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"aii_abt","name":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","commonName":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","title":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"08b7c4463dda6adc56b2c377f42d67ace350af655720940a2e395776a718fc6c","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":61,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ܫܡܹܥ، ܝܵܐ ܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ، ܠܡܲܩܘܲܚܬ‌ܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܨܘܼܬ ܠܨܠܘܿܬ‌ܝܼ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡ̣ܢ ܦܪܵܩܬܵ‌ܐ ܕܐܲܪܥܵܐ ܒܸܬ ܩܵܪܹܝܢ ܐܸܠܘܼܟ݂ ܟܲܕ ܕܘܼܪܕܸܫ̃ܵܐ ܠܸܒܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡܗܲܕܝܼ ܠܝܼ ܠܐܝܼܨܵܪܵܐ ܒܘܼܫ ܪܵܡܵܐ ܡܸܢܝܼ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܣܵܒܵܒ ܗܘܹܐ ܠܘܼܟ݂ ܒܹܝܬ ܓܵܘܣܵܐ ܐܸܠܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܘܼܪܓ̰ܵܐ ܙܲܪܒܵܢܵܐ ܩܲܕܡ ܕܸܫ̃ܡܸܢ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܸܬ ܥܵܡܪܹܢ ܓܵܘ ܡܲܫܟܢܘܼܟ݂ ܠܥܵܠܡܝܼܢ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܸܬ ܫܵܩܠܹܢ ܓܵܘܣܵܐ ܒܣܸܬܵܪܵܐ ܕܓܘܼܠܦܵܢܘܼ̈ܟ݂. ܣܹܠܵܗ","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܗ̇ܝ ܕܐܲܢ݇ܬ، ܝܵܐ ܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ، ܫܡܝܼܥ ܠܘܼܟ݂ ܢܸܕܪ̈ܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܩܵܡ ܝܵܗܒܹܬ ܠܝܼ ܝܘܼܪܬܵܢܵܐ ܥܲܡ ܙܕܝܼ̈ܥܹܐ ܕܫܸܡܘܼܟ݂.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܝܵܘܡܵܢܹ̈ܐ ܒܸܬ ܡܲܙܝܸܕܸܬ ܥܲܠܔ ܝܵܘܡܵܢܹ̈ܐ ܕܡܲܠܟܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܫܸܢܘܼ̈ܗ‌ܝ ܒܸܬ ܗܵܘܝܼ ܠܕܵܪܵܐ ܘܕܵܪܵܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܸܬ ܝܵܬܹܒ݂ ܠܥܵܠܲܡ ܩܲܕܡ ܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܦܩܘܿܕ ܛܲܝܒܘܼܬܵ‌ܐ ܘܫܪܵܪܵܐ ܠܸܢܛܵܪܵܐ ܐܸܠܹܗ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܗܵܕܟ݂ܵܐ ܠܫܸܡܘܼܟ݂ ܒܸܬ ܙܵܡܪܹܢ ܠܥܵܠܲܡ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܟܲܕ ܬܲܡܘܼܡܹܐ ܢܸܕܪ̈ܝܼ ܝܵܘܡܵܐ ܒܝܵܘܡܵܐ.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/61.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/62.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/60.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}